Create:

`assets/documentation/product/graph-ui.md`

The graph is a primary interaction model.

Define:

node
edge
relationship
selection
focus
context
zoom
filter
resolution

The graph must inherit the canonical OX-DX graph visual language.

Avoid generic:

dot + line + arrow

as the entire system.

# ============================================================ 13. OX-DX RESOLUTION SPINE

Create:

`assets/documentation/product/resolution-ui.md`

The 49-level spine becomes a product interaction primitive.

Interaction model:

HIGH CONTEXT
↓
CURRENT LEVEL
↓
RELATED EVIDENCE
↓
DEEPER RESOLUTION

The user should feel like they are resolving a structure.

Not navigating a traditional folder tree.

