Vercel
Raycast
GitHub
OpenAI
Anthropic
Cursor
Arc
Stripe
Supabase
generic IDEs
generic dashboards

Do not create a "dark developer dashboard with neon accents."

That is NOT enough.

Use the established OX-DX visual grammar.

# ============================================================ 45. QURANIC / PHILOSOPHICAL BOUNDARY

The product may visually reflect:

order
measure
relation
observation
layers
resolution

But:

Do not represent product components as religious objects.

Do not use Quranic text as interface decoration.

Do not use sacred symbols as UI icons.

Do not claim technical authority from religious inspiration.

